      "narrative": "Over substitute dom7 (Db7), solo with dom7 arpeggio on substitute root: 'Bar 2: Descending Db7 arpeggio (Db-F-A-Cb)'. Root of Db7 highlights #11/b5 of G7 (chapter 1 p.1-2).",
